  "prefLabel": "Emp 411.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Emp 411.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to establish the procedures to implement the “self-employment assistance program” relative to RSA 282-A:31-g and RSA 282-A:31-h, and known as the “Pathway to Work” (PTW) program.\n\nSource. #11045, eff 2-24-16",
